            <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-3">Visual comparison at three timestamps</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mb-4">Click any thumbnail for full-resolution 400&times;400 centre-crop. License plate is intentionally pixelated; otherwise the frames are unaltered. Same scene through each codec round-trip at <time>t=02:00</time>, <time>05:00</time>, <time>08:00</time>.</p>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-2">
              <div class="text-xs text-center font-semibold text-gray-700">FDC (production)</div>
              <div class="text-xs text-center font-semibold text-gray-700">x264 CRF&nbsp;23</div>
              <div class="text-xs text-center font-semibold text-gray-700">x265 CRF&nbsp;28</div>
              <a href="/images/fdc-ab/fdc-t02m00s.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="block"><img src="/images/fdc-ab/fdc-t02m00s.webp" alt="FDC codec reconstruction at t=2m, outdoor parking scene with parked GMC (license plate pixelated)" class="w-full hover:opacity-90 transition-opacity rounded" loading="lazy" width="400" height="400" /></a>
