            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mb-4">Browser (Chrome DevTools throttled) plus the iOS and Android native apps over a userspace TCP token-bucket proxy &mdash; same NVR, same cameras, same five tiers. Two cameras: a dynamic outdoor intersection (1920&times;1080) and a static outdoor parking scene (2560&times;1448) &mdash; FDC's wire cost tracks scene change, not resolution. Single-camera live view, 60-second steady-state measurement per tier.</p>
